      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but i cant really get an appointment with my doctor until next week and im barely sleeping at all. the stuff with the dex is like the only thing that looks strong enough. does it really happen that often with the serotonin thing? i feel fine right now, i just need to know if i can just take a dose tonight to get through the night.",
